       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. Q3-INTEREST.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-PRINCIPAL PIC 9(8)V99.
       01 WS-RATE PIC 99V99.
       01 WS-YEARS PIC 999.
       01 WS-INTEREST PIC 9(9)V99.
       01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(10)V99.
       01 WS-INT-OUT PIC Z(9)9.99.
       01 WS-TOT-OUT PIC Z(10)9.99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "ENTER PRINCIPAL:".
           ACCEPT WS-PRINCIPAL.
           DISPLAY "ENTER ANNUAL RATE:".
           ACCEPT WS-RATE.
           DISPLAY "ENTER YEARS:".
           ACCEPT WS-YEARS.
           COMPUTE WS-INTEREST =
               WS-PRINCIPAL * WS-RATE * WS-YEARS / 100
           COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = WS-PRINCIPAL + WS-INTEREST
           MOVE WS-INTEREST TO WS-INT-OUT
           MOVE WS-TOTAL TO WS-TOT-OUT
           DISPLAY "INTEREST: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-INT-OUT).
           DISPLAY "TOTAL: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TOT-OUT).
           STOP RUN.
       